    category: "Communication",
    audience: ["all"],
    tags: ["blog", "posts", "publishing", "review"],
    content: "# Three sections, one blog\n\n| Section | Address | Who reads it | Who writes it |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Public** | /blog | Everyone, including visitors | Zebron administrators |\n| **Your organization** | /partner/org/…/blog | Members of that organization | Staff and above; managers publish |\n| **Internal** | /admin/blog | Zebron staff and platform administrators | Zebron administrators |\n\nThe tabs at the top of the blog show only the sections you can read. Every post carries a badge: **Public**, **Members only** or **Zebron staff**.\n\n# Reading\n\n- Open **Blog** from the header menu, the **Zebron Blog** card on All apps, the **Blog** card on your organization dashboard, or a post in **From the Zebron Blog** on the home page.\n- Search, or pick a **topic** chip. On a phone, tap the **search icon** beside the title to show or hide the search bar. A **pinned** post stays at the top.\n- In a post, use **On this page** to jump to a section. React with **Helpful** or **Learned something**, and comment. Signed-in readers can comment on any post they can read.\n- Public posts have **Copy link** for sharing.\n\n# Writing\n\n1. Click **Write** in the blog header.\n2. Add a title, a one or two sentence summary, a cover colour and a topic.\n3. Write the post. The toolbar adds headings (#), bold, lists, quotes, links and code, and tables work as in Knowledge Center articles; **Preview** shows how it will look.\n4. **Save draft** at any time.\n5. **Submit for review** (staff), or **Publish** / **Schedule** (managers and above, and Zebron administrators for Public and Internal).\n\n# Reviewing (Review & manage)\n\n- Managers and above see **Review & manage**, with a count of posts waiting.\n- **Approve and publish** (or **Approve and schedule** when the author chose a date), or **Request changes** with a note for the author.\n- Pin or unpin published posts, unpublish them, edit or delete any post.\n- Scheduled posts go live automatically within 15 minutes of their time.\n\n> Staff can edit and delete their own drafts. Once a post is published, only managers can change it.\n\n# Getting the organization blog\n\nThe organization blog is an **on-demand application**: organizations only have it after requesting it. An administrator requests **Blog** from the organization's applications (Organization Setup), and the owner approves. Until then the Blog link and dashboard card are hidden. The public Zebron blog is always available.",
