    content: "# Switch language\n\n1. Open the **language menu** (globe) in the header.\n2. Choose **Français**. The page switches immediately and your choice is remembered.\n\n# What is translated\n\n- The home page, the onboarding process, the partner portal and the Test Center, including the Quiz Library and the quiz setup card.\n- The Zebron contact mailbox (Inbox, Sent, reading and writing emails, bulk actions and printing).\n- Page titles, notifications and confirmation dialogs.\n\n# What stays in English\n\n- Content people create: names, posts, articles, ticket messages, question text.\n- Emails sent to members and learners, audit log summaries and contract request titles.\n- The shared header menu and footer (for now).\n\n> See English text while French is selected? That screen isn't translated yet. Report it with a support ticket (category **Suggestion**) and include the page address.",
